          <Message>Not supported yet: rebuilding 'ana'/'ANA' from en-US/None to en-US/IgnoreCase throws LiteException 'Cannot insert duplicate key in unique index '_id'' from RebuildContent instead of recording the collision in _rebuild_errors and keeping en-US/None.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
